---

Note on two files: `src/DietSaturationPatch.cs` and `src/DietNutrientHealthBoostPatch.cs`
are Harmony prefixes that fully replace a vanilla Vintage Story method, and their core
control-flow structure necessarily mirrors the corresponding vanilla logic in
`EntityBehaviorHunger` (Vintagestory.GameContent, Anego Studios) in order to correctly
replicate original behavior before layering independent multipliers on top. That mirrored
structure is used under Vintage Story's own mod-source terms (see the license bundled with
the official `vsapi`/`vsessentialsmod` source at https://github.com/anegostudios), not
additionally granted under the MIT license above.
